<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>

<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main>
<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero-section section-dark" id="home">
  <div class="hero-bg-glow"></div>

  <div class="container hero-container">
    <div class="row align-items-center hero-row gy-5">
      <div class="col-lg-6">

        <h1 class="hero-title animate-up delay-1">
          The <span>Intelligence Layer</span> for Energy Trading
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-subtitle animate-up delay-2">
          TraWis connects pricing, weather, geopolitical signals, ETRM, ERP,
          logistics, and contract data into one decision engine for faster,
          smarter trade actions.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions animate-up delay-3">
          <a href="#demo" class="btn btn-brand btn-lg">Schedule Demo</a>
          <a href="/product" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Explore Product</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="hero-product-frame animate-up delay-2" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div class="browser-card hero-demo-card">
            <div class="browser-dots">
              <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>

            <img
              src="/assets/dashboard.png"
              alt="TraWis dashboard preview"
              class="img-fluid product-demo-img"
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


    <!-- INTRO / VALUE STATEMENT -->
    <section class="section section-soft">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center gy-4">
          <div class="col-lg-5">
            <div class="image-chip">
              <img src="/assets/brain image.png" alt="AI energy intelligence graphic">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-7">
            <div class="section-kicker">Unified intelligence</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">
              One decision layer above your existing ETRM, CTRM, and ERP systems.
            </h2>
            <p class="section-text">
              TraWis does not replace existing trading and enterprise systems. It sits above them,
              normalizes internal and external signals, and helps trade desk teams analyze,
              recommend, and initiate decisions through governed workflows.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


<!-- PROBLEMS ADDRESSED -->
<section class="section problem-section" id="problem">
  <!-- Animated background cutouts -->
  <div class="problem-cutout problem-cutout-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/assets/dashboard.png" alt="">
  </div>

  <div class="problem-cutout problem-cutout-2" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/assets/stock-graph.jpg" alt="">
  </div>

  <div class="problem-cutout problem-cutout-3" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/assets/spreadsheet.jpg" alt="">
  </div>

  <div class="container problem-container">
    <div class="section-heading text-center">
      <div class="section-kicker">Problems addressed</div>

      <h2 class="section-title">
        Energy trading teams are drowning in signals, systems, and spreadsheets.
      </h2>

      <p class="section-text mx-auto">
        TraWis is designed for trading desk personas that need faster pricing intelligence,
        risk visibility, and explainable recommendations.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <article class="feature-card problem-card">
          <div class="problem-number">1</div>
          <h3>Fragmented data</h3>
          <p>
            ETRM, ERP, logistics, contracts, market feeds, and weather data remain disconnected.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <article class="feature-card problem-card">
          <div class="problem-number">2</div>
          <h3>Delayed decisions</h3>
          <p>
            Traders and risk managers lose speed when analysis happens across multiple tools.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <article class="feature-card problem-card">
          <div class="problem-number">3</div>
          <h3>Margin exposure</h3>
          <p>
            Late visibility into P&amp;L and risk can create preventable exposure and inefficiency.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <article class="feature-card problem-card">
          <div class="problem-number">4</div>
          <h3>Manual workflows</h3>
          <p>
            Critical trading strategies often move through spreadsheets before execution systems.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


    <!-- PRODUCT DEMO -->
    <section class="section section-dark product-section" id="product">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center gy-5">
          <div class="col-lg-5">
            <div class="section-kicker">Product preview</div>
            <h2 class="section-title text-white">
              Designed for traders, pricers, schedulers, and risk managers.
            </h2>
            <p class="section-text text-white-70">
              The product experience should feel like an intelligence workbench:
              predictive signals, recommended actions, confidence scores, risk alerts,
              and audit-ready decision trails.
            </p>

            <ul class="check-list">
              <li>Predictive pricing and spread forecasting</li>
              <li>Buy, sell, hedge, and risk recommendations</li>
              <li>Explainable and governed decision trails</li>
              <li>Real-time aggregation of trading-critical data</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-7">
            <div class="demo-gallery">
              <div class="browser-card demo-card-large">
                <div class="browser-dots">
                  <span></span><span></span><span></span>
                </div>
                <img src="/assets/dashboard.png" alt="TraWis product dashboard" class="img-fluid product-demo-img">
              </div>

              <div class="demo-stack">
                <img src="/assets/pricing.png" alt="Pricing engine screen">
                <img src="/assets/ai-platform.png" alt="Core platform screen">
                <img src="/assets/recs.png" alt="Recommendation layer screen">
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- 3 LAYER MODEL -->
    <section class="section" id="model">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <div class="section-kicker">3-layer intelligence model</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">From prediction to platform to action.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <article class="layer-card">
              <div class="layer-img">
                <img src="/assets/pricing.png" alt="Commodity price prediction engine">
              </div>
              <span>Layer 1</span>
              <h3>Commodity Price Prediction Engine</h3>
              <p>
                Uses historical market data, weather signals, and geopolitical sentiment
                to forecast pricing and confidence.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <article class="layer-card">
              <div class="layer-img">
                <img src="/assets/ai-platform.png" alt="TraWis core platform">
              </div>
              <span>Layer 2</span>
              <h3>TraWis Core Platform</h3>
              <p>
                Normalizes internal operator data from systems such as ETRM, ERP,
                logistics, contracts, and trade records.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <article class="layer-card">
              <div class="layer-img">
                <img src="/assets/recs.png" alt="Agentic recommendation layer">
              </div>
              <span>Layer 3</span>
              <h3>Agentic Recommendation Layer</h3>
              <p>
                Generates role-based recommendations for trading, pricing, scheduling,
                hedging, and risk actions.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- IMPACT -->
    <section class="section section-soft" id="impact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <div class="section-kicker">Business impact</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">
            Directly improving the <span class="text-brand">bottom line</span>.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="impact-grid">
          <div class="impact-card">
            <strong data-count="50">0</strong>
            <span>%</span>
            <p>Faster decision cycles</p>
          </div>

          <div class="impact-card">
            <strong data-count="3">0</strong>
            <span>%</span>
            <p>Margin increase through early signal detection</p>
          </div>

          <div class="impact-card">
            <strong data-count="40">0</strong>
            <span>%</span>
            <p>Reduction in exposure risk</p>
          </div>

          <div class="impact-card">
            <strong data-count="25">0</strong>
            <span>%</span>
            <p>Fewer manual tasks through automation</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- PRICING / MODULAR -->
    <section class="section" id="pricing">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center gy-4">
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="section-kicker">Modular adoption</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Start small. Scale across the trade desk.</h2>
            <p class="section-text">
              TraWis can be adopted modularly, allowing operators to begin with a less critical
              function such as scheduler or pricer, prove value, and expand to other roles.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="pricing-card">
              <div class="pricing-row">
                <span>Core Platform</span>
                <strong>By installation</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="pricing-row">
                <span>Pricing Prediction Engine</span>
                <strong>By commodity</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="pricing-row">
                <span>API Connectors</span>
                <strong>By connected application</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="pricing-row">
                <span>Trade / Risk / Pricing / Scheduler Agents</span>
                <strong>By users</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="pricing-row">
                <span>Deployment Services</span>
                <strong>Set up</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- DEMO CTA -->
    <section class="section demo-cta" id="demo">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-card">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker">Ready for a walkthrough?</div>
            <h2>See how TraWis can simplify trade intelligence.</h2>
            <p>
              Schedule a product demo to explore predictive pricing, trade recommendations,
              risk alerts, and workflow-based approvals.
            </p><br>
            <a href="/demo" class="btn btn-brand btn-lg">
            Schedule Demo
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>